    "TXN-LOCAL"
  ],
  "description": "Process a begins a transaction and updates row 1; process b, three times, closes and reopens its Database after DBEngine.SetOption calls in its own process (condition 1: dbLockRetry 1 and dbLockDelay 1; condition 2: dbLockRetry 5 and dbLockDelay 100; condition 3: condition 2's values plus dbPageTimeout 100) and updates the same row (errors recorded, call timings recorded by the worker). Process a rolls back; both read row 1. Asks how the conflicting call ends under each setting; engine defaults are read in txn-local-xproc-same-row, not here.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
